// Finite smoke check for the same scene and script renderer used by the example.
Run Setup/Config
Run Examples/World/Setup_Sprite_Garden
Graphics Add_Window Main "Sprite Garden smoke check" 1024 704
Graphics Set_GUI_Visible False
Run Examples/World/Define_Sprite_Garden_Renderer
Run Examples/World/Bind_Sprite_Garden
Run Examples/Graphics/Setup_Characters
Graphics Render
Graphics Update
Graphics Render
Graphics Update
Print (World Get_Tile Garden 0 0 Name)
Print (World Get_Tile Orchard 7 0 Name)
Print (World Get_Tile Scenery 0 6 ID)
Print (World Get_Tile Scenery 8 6 ID)
Print (World Get_Tile Scenery 12 7 Name)
Print (World Get_Tile Orchard 0 0 X)
Print (World Get_Tile Scenery 0 6 Y)
Graphics Close_All
World Close_Scene Sprite_Garden
Print SPRITE_GARDEN_PASSED
Done
